        <mxCell id="step1_ready" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 1 complete&lt;/b&gt;
SupervisorBriefResult
- brief
- supervisor_message
RunContext already has:
- supervisor_brief
- question_registry
- answer_matrix" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#713f12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="170" width="250" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="first_pass_entry" value="&lt;b&gt;_run_first_pass(...)&lt;/b&gt;
_record_phase(run_context, 'first_pass')

Calls run_supervisor_loop(
  brief, run_context, agents, on_message
)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="170" width="420" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="runner_collect" value="&lt;b&gt;Collect loop result&lt;/b&gt;
sections
department_packages
loop_messages
completed_backlog
department_timings
first_round_resolution

state.messages.extend(loop_messages)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="2130" width="420" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="runner_budget" value="&lt;b&gt;First-pass budget accounting&lt;/b&gt;
first_pass_snapshot = short_term_memory.snapshot()
first_pass_tokens = usage_totals.total_tokens
budget_tracker.record_phase_tokens('first_pass', first_pass_tokens)
if budget exceeded:
  record_stop('first_pass', 'token_budget_exceeded')" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="2300" width="420" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="loop_init" value="&lt;b&gt;run_supervisor_loop(...)&lt;/b&gt;
Ensure question_registry + answer_matrix exist
Initialize local outputs:
sections, department_packages, messages, completed_backlog, department_timings" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="160" width="430" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="assignments" value="&lt;b&gt;Build task contracts&lt;/b&gt;
assignments = build_initial_assignments(brief)
department_assignments = build_department_assignments(brief)

Each Assignment carries:
task_key, assignee, target_section, objective, model_name, allowed_tools, depends_on, run_condition, question_ids" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="320" width="430" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="opening" value="&lt;b&gt;Supervisor opening + active tasks&lt;/b&gt;
emit Supervisor opening_message()
For every non-synthesis task:
run_context.record_task(... status='assigned' ...)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="520" width="430" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="parallel_assign" value="&lt;b&gt;Phase 1: parallel batch&lt;/b&gt;
_PARALLEL_BATCH = {CompanyDepartment, MarketDepartment}
For each department:
- emit department_assigned
- create isolated working_set + baseline
- submit _run_single_department(...) to ThreadPoolExecutor" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="700" width="430" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="parallel_review" value="&lt;b&gt;As each parallel future completes&lt;/b&gt;
section_payload, department_messages, package = future.result()
Supervisor accept_department_package(...)
_apply_structured_runtime_artifacts(...)
_apply_acceptance_gate(...)
emit department_package_reviewed
update task statuses + answer matrix" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="1110" width="430" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="merge" value="&lt;b&gt;Merge parallel memory deltas&lt;/b&gt;
For dept in canonical order:
  delta = working_set.delta_from(baseline)
  main short_term_memory.merge_from(delta)

Prevents concurrent writes and duplicate seeded data." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#713f12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="1330" width="430" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sequential" value="&lt;b&gt;Phase 2: sequential departments&lt;/b&gt;
_SEQUENTIAL_AFTER = [BuyerDepartment, ContactDepartment]
For each department:
- emit department_assigned
- evaluate_run_conditions(...)
- skipped tasks become status='skipped'
- runnable tasks execute in order" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="1540" width="430" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="contact_enrich" value="&lt;b&gt;Contact dependency handling&lt;/b&gt;
When department == ContactDepartment:
read sections['market_network']
extract buyer_candidates from downstream_buyers, service_providers, cross_industry_buyers
add buyer_candidates to current_section when available" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=#16a34a;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#14532d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="1750" width="430" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="resolution" value="&lt;b&gt;First-round resolution&lt;/b&gt;
ResolutionController().classify(
  sections, department_packages, answer_matrix, task_statuses
)

emit {status: 'first_round_resolution', ...}
Synthesis intentionally not run here." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#dc2626;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#7f1d1d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="1960" width="430" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dept_company" value="&lt;b&gt;CompanyDepartment&lt;/b&gt;
AG2 DepartmentRuntime.run(...)
Receives isolated working-set memory in parallel phase
Returns section_payload, messages, package" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#14532d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="720" width="340" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dept_market" value="&lt;b&gt;MarketDepartment&lt;/b&gt;
AG2 DepartmentRuntime.run(...)
Runs concurrently with CompanyDepartment
Returns industry_analysis / market evidence package" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#14532d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="880" width="340" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dept_buyer" value="&lt;b&gt;BuyerDepartment&lt;/b&gt;
Runs after Company + Market admission
Uses current_sections snapshot
Builds peer/buyer/redeployment package" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#14532d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="1540" width="340" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dept_contact" value="&lt;b&gt;ContactDepartment&lt;/b&gt;
Runs after BuyerDepartment
May receive buyer_candidates from admitted market_network
Builds contact_intelligence package" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#14532d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="1740" width="340" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="active_tasks" value="&lt;b&gt;RunContext.active_tasks&lt;/b&gt;
Every non-synthesis assignment is recorded as assigned. Later status updates overwrite matching task_key." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#713f12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1780" y="520" width="320" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="structured_state" value="&lt;b&gt;Structured runtime artifacts&lt;/b&gt;
AnswerMatrixUpdate
GapCandidate
EvidencePacket
are validated and appended to short_term_memory.
answer_matrix entries receive status, answer, notes, source_tasks." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#713f12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1780" y="1110" width="320" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sections_state" value="&lt;b&gt;Admission-controlled outputs&lt;/b&gt;
accepted -&gt; section payload visible
accepted_with_gaps -&gt; section payload with _admission marker
rejected -&gt; BlockedArtifact section
Raw package is always preserved in department_packages." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#713f12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1780" y="1310" width="320" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="answer_matrix" value="&lt;b&gt;Task status -&gt; answer matrix&lt;/b&gt;
accepted -&gt; answered
degraded/blocked -&gt; partially_answered
skipped -&gt; blocked

completed_backlog records task_key, label, target_section, status." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#713f12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1780" y="1540" width="320" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="token_guard" value="&lt;b&gt;Token guardrails inside loop&lt;/b&gt;
After sequential departments, usage_totals.total_tokens is checked against HARD_TOKEN_CAP and SOFT_TOKEN_BUDGET.
Hard cap breaks remaining departments." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#dc2626;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#7f1d1d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1780" y="1740" width="320" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="first_pass_state" value="&lt;b&gt;Runner writes first-pass state&lt;/b&gt;
resolution_state['first_round_resolution'] = first_round_resolution
resolution_state['auto_close'] = {triggered: False, max_questions: 4, attempted_questions: 0, stop_reason: 'not_required', remaining_public_gaps: []}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#713f12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1780" y="2130" width="320" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="checkpoint" value="&lt;b&gt;Checkpoint: after_first_pass&lt;/b&gt;
_write_checkpoint(run_dir, 'after_first_pass', run_context)

Step 2 boundary: returns FirstPassResult.
Next step is auto-close decision / closure." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#dc2626;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#7f1d1d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1780" y="2350" width="320" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
